{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-abyure",
  "id": "source-36901",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "36901001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这里……是哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "等下，为什么这次是我说这样的台词啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……冷静，先观察周围的情况。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这里应该是仓库一样的地方……视线有点低……为什么东西看上去都那么大？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "身体的状态也有点奇怪……手上的感觉是……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "塑料？！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "我变成了塑料小人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一段时间后……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "冷静，冷静，百合，你不会被这点小事吓到。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "首先……要走出去看看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901013",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……看起来这里没有其他人。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊，天使？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "站住，不要动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "百合，找到你了。刚才就听到你的声音了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "再靠近的话，我就开枪了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "你忘了吗？我们已经没有争斗的必要了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊？你可是神的使者，天使哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "天使是我们「死后世界战线」所一直对抗的敌人……\n等等，啊，有点奇怪……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我们早就和好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "而且，这里已经不是「死后的世界」了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36901023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "你说什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
